---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="[Free Event | Zoom + YouTube] Zero-Foundation Software Agents: Mid-August 2026 Progress & Deployment Demo" description="ZJU AI Agent / AI Agent Alliance Lecture Series: Mid-August 2026 progress on software agents, featuring live cloud deployment demos of OpenClaw, Hermes, IronClaw, Harness Engineering / DeepSeek Harness overview, and comparative practice on NanoClaw, ZeroClaw, KimiClaw, Claude Cowork." path="/en/posts/2026-08-18-software-agents-august-2026-progress-and-deployment-demo/">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
    <a href="/en/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 text-sm text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-400 mb-8 transition-colors">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
      <span>Back to Home</span>
    </a>

    <article class="space-y-8">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-900 pb-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2">
          <time datetime="2026-08-21">August 21, 2026</time>
          <span>·</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 font-semibold">Event Notice</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          [Free & Public Event | Zoom + YouTube] Zero-Foundation Software Agents: Mid-August 2026 Progress & Deployment Demo
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-x-2">
          <span>Organizers: ZJUAANC, NACUAA DC & NACUAA AI Entrepreneurship Club</span>
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Event Hero Poster Banner -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl">
        <img src="/images/software_agents_banner.jpg" alt="Zero-Foundation Software Agents Banner" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" />
      </div>

      <div class="text-slate-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-200 font-medium">
          Hello everyone!
        </p>
        <p>
          This Saturday we continue our Zhejiang University AI Agent / AI Agent Alliance lecture series, focusing on <strong>software agents (OpenClaw / "Lobster" and related tools) mid-August 2026 progress</strong>, featuring cloud deployment live demos, Harness Engineering / DeepSeek Harness overview, and multi-tool comparative practice.
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-900/80 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl text-slate-300 text-sm italic leading-relaxed">
          Previously, we introduced OpenClaw setup and deployment in the ClawBible series, and discussed robotics and physical intelligence in the "Embodied Intelligence & Physical AI" series. This session returns to pure software agents.
        </div>

        <!-- RSVP Callout Box -->
        <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-950/60 to-purple-950/60 border border-blue-800/40 rounded-3xl flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 shadow-xl">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">🎟️ Free Event Registration</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300">Click below to RSVP on Luma for Zoom and YouTube meeting reminders.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="https://luma.com/4hqx3nha" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-6 py-3 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-semibold text-sm rounded-2xl shrink-0 transition-colors shadow-lg flex items-center gap-x-2">
            <span>RSVP on Luma</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-xs"></i>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="font-medium text-slate-200">
          Designed for both beginners and advanced tech enthusiasts, addressing:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-blue-300 font-medium">
          <li>Where do mainstream software agents stand today?</li>
          <li>How to quickly deploy OpenClaw, Hermes, and IronClaw on the cloud?</li>
          <li>What is Harness Engineering? What do DeepSeek Harness (open source runtime) and multimodal progress imply?</li>
          <li>How to choose and use NanoClaw / ZeroClaw / KimiClaw / Claude Cowork?</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">📅 Date & Time</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Pacific Time (PDT)</strong>: Saturday, Aug 22, 5:30 PM – 6:30 PM</li>
          <li><strong>Eastern Time (EDT)</strong>: Saturday, Aug 22, 8:30 PM – 9:30 PM</li>
          <li><strong>Beijing Time (CST)</strong>: Sunday, Aug 23, 8:30 AM – 9:30 AM</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">🎥 Format & How to Join</h3>
        <p>
          <strong>Zoom Online Meeting + YouTube Live Stream</strong> (Recording available after the event). Approx. 60 minutes.<br />
          <strong>RSVP Link</strong>: <a href="https://luma.com/4hqx3nha" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline font-semibold">https://luma.com/4hqx3nha</a><br />
          <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm">(Zoom & YouTube links will be posted to WeChat groups and sent to registered Luma emails prior to start)</span>
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">🕒 Session Agenda (~60 Mins)</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 my-4 text-xs">
          <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 p-4 rounded-2xl">
            <div class="text-purple-400 font-bold text-sm mb-1">1. Opening & Harness</div>
            <div class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">Michael (20–25 mins)</div>
            <p class="text-slate-400">Software Agents Landscape + OpenClaw / Hermes / IronClaw Demos + Harness Engineering / DeepSeek Harness</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 p-4 rounded-2xl">
            <div class="text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm mb-1">2. Four-Tool Comparison</div>
            <div class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">Zachry (30 mins)</div>
            <p class="text-slate-400">NanoClaw / ZeroClaw / KimiClaw / Claude Cowork Practice</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 p-4 rounded-2xl">
            <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold text-sm mb-1">3. Q&A Interactive</div>
            <div class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">All Speakers (5–10 mins)</div>
            <p class="text-slate-400">Tool Selection, Cloud Deployment, Security Keys & Harness FAQ</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">📋 Detailed Agenda</h3>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm">
          <div class="bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/80 p-5 rounded-2xl space-y-2">
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-purple-300">Part I: Michael Part 1 (~12–15 mins)</h4>
            <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
              <li><strong>Series Connection</strong>: ClawBible → Embodied AI → Software Agents</li>
              <li><strong>Agents ≠ Chatbots</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Mid-August 2026 Map</strong>: OpenClaw, Hermes, IronClaw / NanoClaw / ZeroClaw, KimiClaw, Claude Cowork</li>
              <li><strong>Trends</strong>: OpenClaw ecosystem benchmark, Security & lightweight split, Low-ops cloud deployment</li>
              <li><strong>Security Baseline</strong>: Least privilege, Keeping keys out of group chats, Separating lab & prod</li>
              <li><strong>Cloud Demos</strong>: OpenClaw, Hermes, IronClaw (Minimal Loop)</li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/80 p-5 rounded-2xl space-y-2">
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-purple-300">Part II: Michael Part 2 (~8–10 mins)</h4>
            <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
              <li><strong>Formula</strong>: Agent = Model + Harness</li>
              <li><strong>Prompt / Context / Loop / Graph / Harness</strong> roles</li>
              <li><strong>DeepSeek Harness (dsh)</strong>: MIT License, Everything is a Plugin, Developer Preview</li>
              <li><strong>Multimodal</strong>: Official text+image enhancements; Community vision bridge</li>
              <li><strong>Relationship to "Lobster" Products</strong>: Runtime layer vs Ready-to-use Agent products</li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/80 p-5 rounded-2xl space-y-2">
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-blue-300">Part III: Zachry (~30 mins)</h4>
            <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
              <li><strong>Framework</strong>: Deployment / Security Isolation / Chinese UX / Target Audience</li>
              <li><strong>NanoClaw, ZeroClaw, KimiClaw, Claude Cowork</strong> Hands-on Practice</li>
              <li><strong>Selection Advice & 3 Steps for Beginners</strong></li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/80 p-5 rounded-2xl space-y-2">
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-emerald-300">Part IV: Q&A (~5–10 mins)</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs">
              Deployment, selection, security, Harness, and series FAQ
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">🎤 Guest Speakers</h3>

        <!-- Speaker Cards Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-6">
          <!-- 刘斌 (Bin Liu) -->
          <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center hover:border-purple-500/40 transition-colors">
            <a href="/images/speaker_michael.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block group">
              <img src="/images/speaker_michael.jpg" alt="刘斌 (Bin Liu)" class="w-28 h-28 object-cover rounded-full border-4 border-purple-500 mx-auto mb-4 shadow-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform" />
            </a>
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">刘斌 (Bin Liu)</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-purple-400 font-semibold mb-2">Session Role: Opening 20–25 mins</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Former ZJU faculty; 28 years software & systems experience; Founding VP of ZJUAANC; Chair of NACUAA AI Entrepreneurship Club; President of ViaAI Foundation. Presenting software agent ecosystem summary, OpenClaw, Hermes, IronClaw cloud deployment demos, Harness Engineering, DeepSeek Harness runtime & multimodal progress.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Zachry Xiong -->
          <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center hover:border-blue-500/40 transition-colors">
            <a href="/images/speaker_zachry.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block group">
              <img src="/images/speaker_zachry.jpg" alt="Zachry Xiong" class="w-28 h-28 object-cover rounded-full border-4 border-blue-500 mx-auto mb-4 shadow-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform" />
            </a>
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">Zachry Xiong</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-blue-400 font-semibold mb-2">Session Role: ~30 mins</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Texas State University; former Software Engineer at Charles Schwab and Central One Credit Union. Presenting NanoClaw, ZeroClaw, KimiClaw, Claude Cowork comparison & hands-on practice.<br />
              <a href="https://www.panda-ai-lab.us/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline mt-1 inline-block">panda-ai-lab.us</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">📱 WeChat Group & Contact</h3>
        <p>
          Add WeChat ID <strong><code>zjuaanc</code></strong> (ZJUAANC official account) with note "AI Agents Lecture" to join the WeChat discussion group.
        </p>
        <div class="my-6 text-center">
          <a href="/images/zjuaanc_wechat_qr.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block group">
            <img src="/images/zjuaanc_wechat_qr.jpg" alt="WeChat ID zjuaanc" class="w-64 h-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 shadow-xl mx-auto group-hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors" />
          </a>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">Scan QR Code to add WeChat ID (zjuaanc) to join the lecture group</p>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">🏛️ Organizers & Partners</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li><strong>Organizers</strong>: ZJUAANC, NACUAA DC (Northern California Chapter), NACUAA AI Entrepreneurship Club</li>
          <li><strong>Co-Organizers</strong>: AI Agent Alliance, ZJU AI Agents, ViaAI Foundation, ViaAI Public Welfare Foundation</li>
          <li><strong>Supporting Partners</strong>: Tennessee, Philadelphia, Rhode Island, Florida ZJU Alumni Associations; NACUAA NC, SC, Washington DC Chapters</li>
          <li><strong>Media Partner</strong>: North Alpha Post (北美发布)</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 pt-4">
          All alumni and friends interested in AI agents, OpenClaw, and cloud/local deployment are welcome!<br />
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">This event is free and public; no wire transfers or verification codes are ever requested.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
